"The site also uses analytics cookies (Google Analytics) to anonymously "
"measure audience traffic."

#: templates/privacy_policy.html:92
msgid "3. Finalité du traitement"
msgstr "3. Purpose of Processing"

#: templates/privacy_policy.html:94
msgid "Répondre à vos messages via le formulaire de contact"
msgstr "Respond to your messages sent via the contact form"

#: templates/privacy_policy.html:95
msgid ""
"Améliorer le contenu et l'expérience du site grâce aux statistiques anonymes"
msgstr ""
"Improve the site's content and user experience using anonymous statistics"

#: templates/privacy_policy.html:100
msgid "4. Application mobile"
msgstr "4. Mobile Application"

#: templates/privacy_policy.html:101
msgid ""
"L'application mobile accède uniquement aux articles publiés via une API "
"publique en lecture seule. Aucune donnée personnelle n'est collectée par "
"l'application."
msgstr ""
"The mobile application only accesses published articles through a read-only "
"public API. No personal data is collected by the application."

#: templates/privacy_policy.html:105
msgid "5. Cookies"
msgstr "5. Cookies"

#: templates/privacy_policy.html:106
msgid ""
"Nous utilisons des cookies analytiques (Google Analytics) qui collectent des "
"données anonymes sur votre navigation (pages visitées, durée, pays). Vous "
"pouvez désactiver ces cookies via les paramètres de votre navigateur."
msgstr ""
"We use analytics cookies (Google Analytics) that collect anonymous data "
"about your browsing (pages visited, duration, country). You can disable "
"these cookies through your browser settings."

#: templates/privacy_policy.html:110
msgid "6. Conservation des données"
msgstr "6. Data Retention"

#: templates/privacy_policy.html:111
msgid ""
"Les messages du formulaire de contact sont conservés le temps nécessaire "
"pour y répondre. Les données analytiques sont anonymisées et agrégées."
msgstr ""
"Messages sent through the contact form are kept for as long as necessary to "
"respond to them. Analytics data is anonymized and aggregated."

