"support you at every stage of your healthcare journey."

#: templates/services.html:220
msgid "Diagnostic précis grâce à des équipements médicaux de pointe."
msgstr "Accurate diagnosis with advanced medical equipment."

#: templates/services.html:225
msgid "Plans de traitement personnalisés pour chaque patient."
msgstr "Personalized treatment plans for each patient."

#: templates/services.html:230
msgid ""
