"pathologie."
msgstr ""
"Regular follow-up to adjust treatment according to the progression of the "
"condition."

#: templates/services.html:235
msgid ""
"Prise en charge multidisciplinaire (médecins, infirmiers, spécialistes)."
msgstr "Multidisciplinary care (doctors, nurses, specialists)."

#: templates/services.html:246
msgid ""
"Protégez-vous et protégez vos proches grâce à nos services de vaccination "
"complète. Nous offrons des vaccins pour tous les âges et toutes les "
"conditions médicales."
msgstr ""
"Protect yourself and your loved ones with our comprehensive vaccination "
"services. We offer vaccines for all ages and all medical conditions."

#: templates/services.html:259
msgid "Vaccins disponibles pour les enfants, les adultes et les seniors."
msgstr "Vaccines available for children, adults, and seniors."

#: templates/services.html:264
msgid ""
"Conseils personnalisés sur les vaccins nécessaires en fonction de votre "
"profil médical."
msgstr "Personalized advice on vaccines needed based on your medical profile."

#: templates/services.html:269
msgid "Suivi post-vaccination pour assurer votre sécurité et votre confort."
msgstr "Post-vaccination follow-up to ensure your safety and comfort."

#: templates/services.html:274
msgid ""
"Vaccins contre les maladies courantes (poliomelythe, grippe, COVID-19, "
"hépatite, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"Vaccines against common diseases (polio, flu, COVID-19, hepatitis, etc.)."

